" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-medium\">Gulf Oasis Travels & Tourism Event<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-8891cfc elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default row-top\" data-eae-slider=\"92198\" data-id=\"8891cfc\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-d8e3c9f\" data-eae-slider=\"31666\" data-id=\"d8e3c9f\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cec0de9 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-gva-heading-block\" data-id=\"cec0de9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"gva-heading-block.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gva-element-gva-heading-block gva-element\">   <div class=\"align-left style-1 widget gsc-heading box-align-left auto-responsive\">\r\n      <div class=\"content-inner\">\r\n         \r\n                  \r\n           \r\n         \r\n                     <h2 class=\"title\">\r\n               <span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2px;\">Details<\/span><\/span>\r\n            <\/h2>\r\n                  \r\n         \r\n      <\/div>\r\n   <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-45160c1 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default row-top\" data-eae-slider=\"78114\" data-id=\"45160c1\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-b579d77\" data-eae-slider=\"21409\" data-id=\"b579d77\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a7f5f0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6a7f5f0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"410\">Gulf Oasis Travels & Tourism is proud to have been part of a momentous celebration marking a significant chapter in the enduring friendship between the <strong data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"374\">Philippines<\/strong> and the <strong data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"407\">United Arab Emirates<\/strong>.<\/p><p data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"737\">Hosted by <strong data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"455\">H.E. Alfonso Ferdinand A. Ver<\/strong>, Ambassador of the Republic of the Philippines to the UAE, the elegant reception took place at the <strong data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\">Emirates Palace Mandarin Oriental<\/strong>, commemorating both the <strong data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"677\">50th Anniversary of Philippines\u2013UAE Diplomatic Relations<\/strong> and the <strong data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"734\">126th Anniversary of Philippine Independence<\/strong>.<\/p><p data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"906\">The event served as a powerful reminder of the shared values, mutual respect, and growing collaboration that continue to strengthen the bond between our two nations.<\/p><p data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"1100\">We at <strong data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"930\">Gulf Oasis Travels & Tourism<\/strong> are honored to have been part of this remarkable occasion and look forward to contributing to the ongoing partnership and goodwill between the Philippines and the UAE.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0bf9447\" data-eae-slider=\"35282\" data-id=\"0bf9447\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7dacbdc elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7dacbdc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"900\" height=\"754\" src=\"https:\/\/gulfoasistravelsandtourism.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/1-event-2.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-8454\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/gulfoasistravelsandtourism.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/1-event-2.jpg 940w, https:\/\/gulfoasistravelsandtourism.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/1-event-2-768x644.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-bf5913e elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default row-top\" data-eae-slider=\"67903\" data-id=\"bf5913e\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"sectio